# Start closed: only runtime source and committed manifests/config examples are
# eligible for the build context.  Local TOML, agent state, secrets, data, and
# generated evidence can therefore never be copied by a broad Dockerfile COPY.
**
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!requirements-runtime.txt
!deployment/
!deployment/**
!dashboard/
!dashboard/**
!persistence/
!persistence/**
!market_data/
!market_data/**
!backtesting/
!backtesting/**
!orchestration/
!orchestration/**
!prefect_spike/
!prefect_spike/**
!strategies/
!strategies/**
!config/
!config/*.py
!config/*.example.toml
!data/
!data/manifests/
!data/manifests/**

**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/*.log
